{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22507","headline":"山鹧鸪 · 白居易","name":"山鹧鸪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山鹧鸪，朝朝暮暮啼复啼，啼时露白风凄凄。\n黄茅冈头秋日晚，苦竹岭下寒月低。\n畲田有粟何不啄，石楠有枝何不栖？\n迢迢不缓复不急，楼上舟中声闇入。\n梦乡迁客展转卧，抱儿寡妇彷徨立。\n山鹧鸪，尔本此乡鸟。\n生不辞巢不别羣，何苦声声啼到晓。\n啼到晓，唯能愁北人，南人惯闻如不闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22507.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22507","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}